review_notes = "One of the strongest current candidates. Rough mottled concrete with useful variation and no dominant square-tile pattern in the current review. Approved for service floors and also for walls where its scale/pattern fits the structural composition. Later EAF4 joints, repairs, drainage, markings, and wear should provide room-scale history rather than baking all variation into the source material."
